{"protocol":"mindblown-brain/1","brain":"projects","page":{"id":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register","title":"Ledgerline Managed Register","type":"project","lobe":"ledger","parent":null,"desc":"Owner-only hosted register, private cutover and file-aware rollback.","intro":"Owner-only hosted register, private cutover and file-aware rollback.","created":"2026-10-08","updated":"2026-10-25","synapses":["projects/ledgerline-managed-register#1","projects/ledgerline-managed-register#2","projects/ledgerline-managed-register#3","projects/ledgerline-managed-register#4","projects/ledgerline-managed-register#5","projects/ledgerline-managed-register#6","projects/ledgerline-managed-register#7","projects/ledgerline-managed-register#8","projects/ledgerline-managed-register#9","projects/ledgerline-managed-register#10","projects/ledgerline-managed-register#11","projects/ledgerline-managed-register#12","projects/ledgerline-managed-register#13"],"sources":["pplx://sessions/dc95a4b6-262c-ed5d-895e-3e73c0c99ded","pplx://sessions/1f6f40af-477e-0165-ee99-ebbfb4646619","pplx://sessions/090985fe-84e3-c4a5-bdf5-43ef827e5fd5","pplx://sessions/72485191-245e-a262-2012-22d654504ace"],"sections":["How it works","See also"]},"url":"https://mindblown.pplx.app/index.html#n=projects%2Fledgerline-managed-register","parent":null,"children":[],"synapses":[{"id":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register#1","page":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register","lead":"No silent audit note changes","text":"the audit note exports per statement and surfaces a plain warning when the category rule is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/dc95a4b6-262c-ed5d-895e-3e73c0c99ded","pplx://sessions/1f6f40af-477e-0165-ee99-ebbfb4646619"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register#2","page":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register","lead":"Default-off weekly CSV","text":"Sam chose to keep the weekly CSV and the page image distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/72485191-245e-a262-2012-22d654504ace","pplx://sessions/090985fe-84e3-c4a5-bdf5-43ef827e5fd5"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register#3","page":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register","lead":"Tracking entry needs an owner choice","text":"tracking entry changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check per statement is bounded evidence, not proof that the audit note works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register#4","page":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register","lead":"Duplicate guard is not acceptance","text":"Sam chose to keep the duplicate guard and the owner sign-in distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/dc95a4b6-262c-ed5d-895e-3e73c0c99ded","pplx://sessions/1f6f40af-477e-0165-ee99-ebbfb4646619"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register#5","page":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register","lead":"Weekly CSV needs an owner choice","text":"an earlier draft treated the weekly CSV as complete; later turns supersede that, and the current state is a tested candidate awaiting the owner's go-ahead.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/090985fe-84e3-c4a5-bdf5-43ef827e5fd5","pplx://sessions/1f6f40af-477e-0165-ee99-ebbfb4646619"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register#6","page":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register","lead":"One page image, two surfaces","text":"an earlier draft treated the page image as complete; later turns supersede that, and the current state is a tested candidate awaiting the owner's go-ahead.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/ledgerline"],"cites":["pplx://sessions/72485191-245e-a262-2012-22d654504ace"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register#7","page":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register","lead":"Audit note needs an owner choice","text":"the audit note protects per statement and surfaces a plain warning when the page image is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/dc95a4b6-262c-ed5d-895e-3e73c0c99ded"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register#8","page":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register","lead":"Rollback bundle is not acceptance","text":"the rollback bundle retains on the hosted copy, but this does not establish duplicate guard acceptance or a new release. Review notes remain separate from the shipped build.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/dc95a4b6-262c-ed5d-895e-3e73c0c99ded","pplx://sessions/090985fe-84e3-c4a5-bdf5-43ef827e5fd5"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register#9","page":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register","lead":"Tracking entry stays explicit","text":"an earlier draft treated the tracking entry as complete; later turns supersede that, and the current state is a tested candidate awaiting the owner's go-ahead.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/dc95a4b6-262c-ed5d-895e-3e73c0c99ded"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register#10","page":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register","lead":"Default-off owner sign-in","text":"the page image is derived from the owner sign-in per statement; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/090985fe-84e3-c4a5-bdf5-43ef827e5fd5"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register#11","page":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register","lead":"Tracking entry with a visible gate","text":"the tracking entry protects on the hosted copy, but this does not establish audit note acceptance or a new release. Review notes remain separate from the shipped build.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/1f6f40af-477e-0165-ee99-ebbfb4646619"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register#12","page":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register","lead":"Weekly CSV before page image","text":"Sam chose to keep the weekly CSV and the page image distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/1f6f40af-477e-0165-ee99-ebbfb4646619"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register#13","page":"projects/ledgerline-managed-register","lead":"One category rule, two surfaces","text":"the audit note is derived from the category rule per statement; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/72485191-245e-a262-2012-22d654504ace"]}],"sources":[{"id":"pplx://sessions/dc95a4b6-262c-ed5d-895e-3e73c0c99ded","label":"dc95a4b6","kind":"session","pages":["projects/ledgerline-email-receipts","projects/ledgerline-managed-register","projects/ledgerline-demo"]},{"id":"pplx://sessions/1f6f40af-477e-0165-ee99-ebbfb4646619","label":"1f6f40af","kind":"session","pages":["projects/hollow-pines-radio","projects/hollow-pines-performance","projects/ledgerline-managed-register","projects/ledgerline-reports","projects/ledgerline-mobile"]},{"id":"pplx://sessions/090985fe-84e3-c4a5-bdf5-43ef827e5fd5","label":"090985fe","kind":"session","pages":["projects/rain-barrel-controller","projects/ledgerline-managed-register","entities/sam-vale"]},{"id":"pplx://sessions/72485191-245e-a262-2012-22d654504ace","label":"72485191","kind":"session","pages":["projects/kinetic-type-experiments","projects/holiday-playlist-for-nan","projects/desk-synth-build","projects/ledgerline","projects/ledgerline-managed-register","projects/ledgerline-mobile"]}],"neighbours":{"out":[{"page":"projects/orbit-kitchen-household-sharing","w":1,"kinds":["link"],"notes":[]},{"page":"projects/ledgerline-mobile","w":5,"kinds":["mention","see-also"],"notes":["public de